{
  "_doc": "Maps exact Odoo project.project names to repo folders under the repos tree (resolved by scripts/repos-dir.sh; override with REPOS_DIR). Edit ONLY via scripts/repo-map.sh (atomic, validated); never hand-edit. Entries are added only with explicit user confirmation. branch_flow is the ordered environment chain, last element production; flow_confirmed: true means a human vouched for that chain. A flow without flow_confirmed was parsed from the old free-text notes and must be confirmed before it drives a promotion. The first element is where task work starts from: where that is a branch cut fresh per task rather than a shared environment, record the reserved placeholder ':task' (a colon is illegal in a git ref name, so it can never collide with a real branch) instead of inventing a name such as 'dev' that exists on no remote. The placeholder is optional, is only ever the first element, and is never default_branch; every other element names a branch that has to exist, because those are what work is promoted into. repo_path is optional and holds an absolute path to the checkout, overriding $REPOS_DIR/$repo for a repo that is not under a flat repos tree (a bind mount such as /mnt/extra-addons); an entry carrying it never consults repos-dir.sh.",
  "projects": {}
}
